# Shell scripts, Python scripts and the Dockerfile keep LF on every platform: with Git for Windows'
# default core.autocrlf=true they would be checked out with CRLF, and `scripts/build.sh` then fails
# under WSL (`/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
